   "text": "Thanks, Maya. You're verified, and I'm sorry about the wait.\n\nOrder K-8101 was promised for 6:15 PM. The courier handed it over at 7:07 PM, which is 52 minutes late. For orders that late, Forkful gives account credit of 20% of the order subtotal, up to a $15 maximum. Your subtotal was $90, so 20% would be $18. The cap applies, and I've added **$15.00 in account credit** to your account. You can use it on a future order.\n\nLate-delivery compensation is credit only, so it can't go back to your card. Is there anything else I can help with?"
